Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y): V8 15.2 has no
parsing_dynamic_function_declaration_ member; the equivalent predicate
here is Parser::ParsingDynamicFunctionDeclaration() (parameters_end_pos_
!= kNoSourcePosition), which is what the removed params_need_validation
local computed, so the eager-compile hint uses that call.

